OL,3,GNEWSANI health trusts to announce 12%
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health and social
OL,7,Fcare trusts are expected to announce
OL,8,Fproposals on how they intend to make
OL,9,Fsavings of up to 12% over three years.
OL,11,FAt the moment, health faces a funding
OL,12,Fgap of #800m.
OL,14,FHealth unions have told BBC News NI
OL,15,Fthey understand jobs will be affected
OL,16,Fas the trusts attempt to make the
OL,17,Fsavings. Those posts could include
OL,18,Fporter and cleaning posts.
OL,20,FUnions are planning to protest later
OL,21,Fthis morning.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
